### SDK Comparison

| Feature | Legacy SDK (`@google/generative-ai`) | New SDK (`@google/genai`) |
|---------|--------------------------------------|---------------------------|
| **Status** | Maintenance mode | ✅ General Availability (GA) |
| **Client Pattern** | `GoogleGenerativeAI` class | Centralized `GoogleGenAI` client |
| **API Access** | `model.generateContent()` | `ai.models.generateContent()` |
| **Services** | Separate client classes | Unified: `models`, `chats`, `files`, `caches`, `tunings` |
| **Recommendation** | Migrate to new SDK | ✅ Use for all new projects |
